.Dd October 20, 2026
.Dt KRAFT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm kraft
.Nd coding agent
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl t
.Op Fl a Ar api
.Op Fl m Ar model
.Op Fl n Ar max_tokens
.Op Fl u Ar url
.Op Ar prompt ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sends
.Ar prompt
(or, if none is given, standard input) to a language model and
streams the reply to standard output.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a Ar api
The API to speak:
.Cm anthropic
(the Anthropic Messages API,
.Pa /v1/messages ,
the default) or
.Cm openai
(an OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions API,
.Pa /v1/chat/completions ) .
.It Fl m Ar model
The model to use.
.It Fl n Ar max_tokens
The most tokens the model may generate.
The default is 8192.
.It Fl t
Copy the model's reasoning, when the server sends it, to standard
error.
.It Fl u Ar url
The base URL of the server, with or without a trailing
.Pa /v1 .
The default is
.Pa http://127.0.0.1:1234 .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
.It Ev KRAFT_API
Default for
.Fl a .
.It Ev KRAFT_MODEL
Default for
.Fl m .
.It Ev KRAFT_URL
Default for
.Fl u .
.It Ev KRAFT_API_KEY
The key to send.
If unset,
.Ev ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
or
.Ev OPENAI_API_KEY
is used, depending on the API.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 on success, 100 on a permanent failure such as bad usage or
a rejected request, and 111 on a temporary failure such as a
network error.
.Sh EXAMPLES
Ask an LM Studio server on another machine:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
kraft -u http://192.168.10.234:1234 -m qwen/qwen3.8-27b 'Say hi'
.Ed
.Sh BUGS
https URLs are not supported yet.
